00:22:12.227 --> 00:22:14.097
And then found himself
wanted for killings

00:22:14.258 --> 00:22:16.177
He claimed were the work
of an invisible force,

00:22:16.761 --> 00:22:18.174
Killings carried
out --Get this --

00:22:18.669 --> 00:22:19.838
With a sharp instrument.

00:22:20.027 --> 00:22:21.129
What's the connection to lori?

00:22:21.739 --> 00:22:24.955
A man of religion who openly
preaches against immorality.

00:22:26.387 --> 00:22:29.009
Except this time instead
of saving the whole town,

00:22:29.009 --> 00:22:30.673
He's trying to save his only daughter.

00:22:30.673 --> 00:22:31.909
Reverend sorenson.

00:22:32.567 --> 00:22:33.874
Do you think he's summoning the spirit?

00:22:34.362 --> 00:22:35.052
Maybe.

00:22:37.050 --> 00:22:38.928
Or you know how a poltergeist

00:22:38.928 --> 00:22:40.664
Can haunt a person instead of a place?

00:22:41.079 --> 00:22:43.470
The spirit latches onto the
reverend's repressed emotions,

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:44.302
Feeds off them.

00:22:46.138 --> 00:22:47.870
Without the reverend
ever even knowing it.

00:22:50.178 --> 00:22:52.565
Either way,  you should
keep an eye on lori tonight.

00:22:53.179 --> 00:22:54.109
What about you?

00:23:00.036 --> 00:23:01.969
I'm gonna go see if I can
find that unmarked grave.

00:24:01.814 --> 00:24:03.713
Here we go.

00:24:40.950 --> 00:24:42.158
That's it.

00:24:42.744 --> 00:24:46.431
Next time,  I get to watch
the cute girl's house.

00:25:00.578 --> 00:25:01.892
Hello,  preacher.

00:25:19.415 --> 00:25:22.020
I saw you from upstairs.

00:25:23.402 --> 00:25:24.884
What are you doing here?

00:25:26.746 --> 00:25:28.649
I'm keeping an eye on the place.

00:25:31.407 --> 00:25:32.764
I was worried.

00:25:32.764 --> 00:25:33.974
About me?

00:25:34.146 --> 00:25:35.839
Yeah,  sorry.

00:25:37.480 --> 00:25:38.760
No,  it's cool.

00:25:40.357 --> 00:25:41.562
I already called the cops.

00:25:44.244 --> 00:25:46.603
No,  seriously, I think you're sweet,

00:25:47.450 --> 00:25:50.139
Which is probably why you
should run away from me

00:25:50.139 --> 00:25:51.402
As fast as you can.

00:25:53.467 --> 00:25:54.882
Why would you say that?

00:25:55.951 --> 00:25:57.699
It's like I'm cursed or something.

00:25:58.438 --> 00:26:00.219
People around me keep dying.

00:26:04.364 --> 00:26:05.852
I thinkI know how you feel.

00:26:32.929 --> 00:26:34.323
Goodbye,  preacher.

00:26:47.237 --> 00:26:48.811
No one will talk to me anymore...

00:26:49.731 --> 00:26:50.812
Except you.

00:26:51.300 --> 00:26:53.099
The sheriff thinks I'm a suspect.

00:26:54.217 --> 00:26:55.581
And you know what my dad will say?

00:26:55.650 --> 00:26:57.473
"Pave faith."

00:26:57.785 --> 00:26:59.636
What does he know about faith?

00:27:02.447 --> 00:27:04.221
I heard you guys fighting before.

00:27:05.966 --> 00:27:09.398
He's seeing a woman, a married woman.

00:27:09.581 --> 00:27:10.871
I just found out.

00:27:12.189 --> 00:27:14.354
She comes to our
church with her husband,

00:27:14.698 --> 00:27:16.290
I know her kids,

00:27:16.815 --> 00:27:20.263
And he talks to me about
religion, about morality?

00:27:21.999 --> 00:27:23.614
It's like on one hand, you know,

00:27:24.354 --> 00:27:25.897
Just do what you want and be happy,

00:27:26.729 --> 00:27:28.878
But he
taught me --

00:27:28.996 --> 00:27:32.076
Raised me to believe that
if you do something wrong,

00:27:32.156 --> 00:27:33.286
You will get punished.

00:27:37.351 --> 00:27:39.550
I just don't know what to think anymore.

00:28:08.665 --> 00:28:09.672
Sam?

00:28:10.229 --> 00:28:11.924
Lori,  I can'T.

00:28:13.755 --> 00:28:15.600
That someone you lost?

00:28:19.584 --> 00:28:21.129
I'm sorry.

00:28:21.260 --> 00:28:21.976
Lori.

00:28:24.436 --> 00:28:26.271
Come inside,  please.

00:28:27.311 --> 00:28:29.047
I'll come in when I'm ready.

00:28:31.536 --> 00:28:33.411
Ack! Aah!

00:28:41.157 --> 00:28:42.746
No! No!

00:28:58.366 --> 00:28:59.195
Dad!

00:29:05.403 --> 00:29:06.948
It's okay.It's all right.

00:29:06.948 --> 00:29:08.404
It's okay. It's okay.

00:29:11.942 --> 00:29:12.937
We were just talking.

00:29:13.540 --> 00:29:17.285
Then lori's dad came
out, and then he appeared.

00:29:17.667 --> 00:29:21.227
A big man carrying a
weapon,  some kind of a hook?

00:29:21.432 --> 00:29:22.460
Yes,  sir.

00:29:23.198 --> 00:29:24.374
Ever seen him before?

00:29:26.254 --> 00:29:27.095
No,  sir.

00:29:28.842 --> 00:29:31.178
Son,  it seems every time I
turn around,  I'm seeing you.

00:29:33.099 --> 00:29:34.786
I suggest you try to
stay out of trouble.

00:29:36.430 --> 00:29:37.225
Yes,  sir.

00:29:38.199 --> 00:29:39.365
It's all right.I'm with him.

00:29:39.381 --> 00:29:42.030
That's my brother.Hey,  brother.

00:29:46.217 --> 00:29:47.257
Let him through.

00:29:47.589 --> 00:29:48.748
Thanks.

00:29:51.186 --> 00:29:52.165
Go ahead.

00:29:56.787 --> 00:29:57.264
You okay?

00:29:57.264 --> 00:29:57.809
Yeah.

00:29:58.336 --> 00:29:59.345
What the hell happened?

00:29:59.805 --> 00:30:00.606
Hookman.

00:30:00.959 --> 00:30:01.729
You saw him?

00:30:01.766 --> 00:30:02.538
Damn right.

00:30:02.712 --> 00:30:03.653
Why didn't you torch the bones?

00:30:03.653 --> 00:30:07.294
I did. Are you sure it's
the spirit of jacob karns?

00:30:07.294 --> 00:30:09.956
Sure as hell looked like
him. And that's not all.

00:30:10.294 --> 00:30:12.311
I don't think the spirit is
latching onto the reverend.

00:30:12.601 --> 00:30:14.720
Yeah,  the guy wouldn't send
the hookman after himself.

00:30:17.567 --> 00:30:19.088
I think it's latching onto lori.

00:30:19.832 --> 00:30:21.337
Last night she found out that her father

00:30:21.337 --> 00:30:23.186
Is having an affair
with a married woman.

00:30:23.342 --> 00:30:24.326
So what?

00:30:24.326 --> 00:30:25.390
So,  she's upset about it.

00:30:25.838 --> 00:30:27.655
She's upset about the immorality of it.

00:30:27.996 --> 00:30:29.428
She was raised to believe

00:30:29.428 --> 00:30:31.404
That if you do something
wrong, you get punished.

00:30:32.149 --> 00:30:33.853
Okay,  so she's conflicted,

00:30:34.164 --> 00:30:35.694
And the spirit of preacher karns

00:30:35.694 --> 00:30:37.248
Is latching onto her emotions

00:30:37.248 --> 00:30:38.733
And doing the punishing for her.

00:30:38.909 --> 00:30:39.772
Right.

00:30:40.113 --> 00:30:41.533
Rich comes on too strong.

00:30:41.703 --> 00:30:43.552
Taylor tries to make
her into a party girl.

00:30:44.122 --> 00:30:45.389
Dad has an affair.

00:30:46.099 --> 00:30:47.714
Remind me not to piss this girl off.

00:30:49.895 --> 00:30:51.938
But I burned those bones.I
buried them in salt.

00:30:52.190 --> 00:30:53.323
Why didn't that stop him?

00:30:54.637 --> 00:30:56.013
You must've missed something.

00:30:57.695 --> 00:30:59.655
No,  I burned everything in that coffin.

00:31:01.019 --> 00:31:02.247
Did you get the hook?

00:31:04.097 --> 00:31:04.897
The hook?

00:31:06.641 --> 00:31:07.662
It was the murder weapon,

00:31:07.839 --> 00:31:09.614
And in a way it was part of him.

00:31:12.515 --> 00:31:13.846
So,  like the bones,

00:31:13.846 --> 00:31:15.342
The hook is a source of his power.

00:31:16.327 --> 00:31:17.801
So,  if we find the hook...

00:31:18.070 --> 00:31:19.694
We stop the hookman.

00:31:27.795 --> 00:31:28.975
Here's something, I think.

00:31:30.490 --> 00:31:32.342
Log book, iowa state penitentiary.

00:31:32.342 --> 00:31:33.403
"Karns,
jacob --

00:31:33.403 --> 00:31:35.701
Personal affects, disposition there of."

00:31:35.701 --> 00:31:36.564
Does it mention the hook?

00:31:38.345 --> 00:31:40.847
"Upon execution,  all earthly
items shall be remanded

00:31:40.847 --> 00:31:42.082
"To the prisoner's houseof worship,

00:31:42.247 --> 00:31:43.504
St. Barnabas church."

00:31:44.953 --> 00:31:46.541
Isn't that where lori's father preaches?

00:31:46.541 --> 00:31:47.076
Yeah.

00:31:48.368 --> 00:31:49.501
Where lori lives?

00:31:50.079 --> 00:31:51.944
That's why the hookman'sbeen
haunting reverends

00:31:51.944 --> 00:31:54.095
And reverends' daughters
for the past 200 years.

00:31:54.095 --> 00:31:56.157
But if the hook were at
the church or lori's house,

00:31:56.157 --> 00:31:57.453
Don't you think someone
might've seen it?

00:31:57.830 --> 00:32:00.406
I mean,  a blood-Stained,
silver-Handled hook?

00:32:02.441 --> 00:32:03.581
Check the church records.

00:32:06.130 --> 00:32:08.614
"St. Barnabas donations, 1862.

00:32:08.614 --> 00:32:10.285
"Received
--Silver-Handled hook

00:32:10.439 --> 00:32:11.737
"From state penitentiary.

00:32:12.857 --> 00:32:13.624
Reforged."

00:32:15.126 --> 00:32:18.083
They melted it down, made
it into something else.

00:32:33.021 --> 00:32:34.417
All right.We can't take any chances.

00:32:34.417 --> 00:32:35.856
Anything silver goes in the fire.

00:32:36.211 --> 00:32:37.208
I agree.

00:32:38.282 --> 00:32:39.492
Lori's still at the hospital.

00:32:39.492 --> 00:32:40.508
We'll have to break in.

00:32:40.891 --> 00:32:41.974
All right, take your pick.

00:32:42.694 --> 00:32:43.575
I'll take the house.

00:32:44.056 --> 00:32:44.624
Okay.

00:32:47.316 --> 00:32:48.300
Hey.

00:32:49.912 --> 00:32:51.368
Stay out of her underwear drawer.

00:33:09.106 --> 00:33:10.864
I got everything that even looks silver.

00:33:10.864 --> 00:33:11.903
Better safe than sorry.

00:33:26.871 --> 00:33:27.694
Move,  move.

00:34:01.778 --> 00:34:02.643
Lori?

00:34:04.436 --> 00:34:05.706
What are you doing here?

00:34:05.706 --> 00:34:06.547
What is it?

00:34:07.763 --> 00:34:11.676
I've been trying to understand
what's been happening,  why.

00:34:12.023 --> 00:34:14.835
Now I know,  so I'm
praying for forgiveness.

00:34:15.746 --> 00:34:17.310
Forgiveness for what?

00:34:17.785 --> 00:34:18.983
Don't you see?

00:34:19.058 --> 00:34:20.768
I'm to blame for all this.

00:34:21.607 --> 00:34:24.704
I've read in the bible
about avenging angels.

00:34:24.782 --> 00:34:25.190
Trust me.

00:34:25.190 --> 00:34:28.469
This guy --
He's no angel.

00:34:29.403 --> 00:34:31.797
I was so angry at my father.

00:34:32.517 --> 00:34:34.461
Part of me wanted him punished,

00:34:35.695 --> 00:34:37.861
And then he came and he punished him.

00:34:38.075 --> 00:34:39.442
It's not your fault.

00:34:39.946 --> 00:34:41.177
Yes,  it is.

00:34:41.619 --> 00:34:43.179
I don't know how, but it is.

00:34:45.541 --> 00:34:46.582
I killed rich.

00:34:46.924 --> 00:34:47.936
Taylor,  too.

00:34:48.337 --> 00:34:49.929
I nearly killed my father.

00:34:50.363 --> 00:34:51.035
Lori.

00:34:53.131 --> 00:34:54.265
I can see it now.

00:34:55.317 --> 00:34:57.011
They didn't deserve to be punished.

00:34:57.381 --> 00:34:58.245
I do.

00:35:10.147 --> 00:35:11.871
Come on.We got to go.

00:35:21.170 --> 00:35:21.872
Go!

00:35:23.505 --> 00:35:24.234
Come on!

00:35:45.397 --> 00:35:46.182
No!

00:35:55.431 --> 00:35:57.144
Come on,  get up.

00:36:11.913 --> 00:36:12.960
Sam,  drop!

00:36:19.313 --> 00:36:20.620
I thought we got all the silver.

00:36:21.379 --> 00:36:22.482
Why is he still here?

00:36:22.517 --> 00:36:23.868
Maybe we missed something.

00:36:26.776 --> 00:36:28.494
Lori,  where did you getthat chain?

00:36:29.103 --> 00:36:30.280
My father gave it to me.

00:36:30.408 --> 00:36:31.294
Where'd your dad get it?

00:36:31.296 --> 00:36:33.183
It was a church
heirloom.He gave it to me.

00:36:33.916 --> 00:36:34.630
Is it silver?

00:36:34.630 --> 00:36:35.110
Yes.

00:36:52.497 --> 00:36:53.196
Sam.

00:38:03.745 --> 00:38:06.380
And you saw him,  too,
the man with the hook?

00:38:06.404 --> 00:38:08.160
Yes,  I told you.We all saw him.

00:38:08.160 --> 00:38:10.017
We fought him off, and then he ran.

00:38:10.569 --> 00:38:11.293
And that's all?

00:38:12.044 --> 00:38:12.853
Yeah,  that's all.

00:38:16.532 --> 00:38:18.669
Listen, you and
your brother --

00:38:18.669 --> 00:38:20.084
Oh,  don't worry.We're leaving town.

00:38:26.933 --> 00:38:28.006
You gonna be okay?

00:38:28.910 --> 00:38:29.855
Yeah.

00:38:39.989 --> 00:38:41.368
I still don't know what happened,

00:38:42.559 --> 00:38:45.399
But I do know you saved my life.

00:38:46.116 --> 00:38:47.275
My father's,  too.

00:38:47.746 --> 00:38:48.581
Thank you.

00:39:14.115 --> 00:39:15.139
We could stay.



